<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Startup Idea Pitch</title>
</head>
<body>

<header>

    <h1>💡 Startup Idea Pitch</h1>

    <p>
        A fictional startup concept.
    </p>

</header>

<hr>

<main>

<section>

    <h2>🚀 Startup Name</h2>

    <h3>StudySpark</h3>

    <p>
        A fictional digital platform designed to help
        students organize their learning resources.
    </p>

</section>

<hr>

<section>

    <h2>❗ Problem</h2>

    <p>
        Students often have learning resources spread
        across multiple places, making them difficult
        to organize.
    </p>

</section>

<hr>

<section>

    <h2>💡 Solution</h2>

    <p>
        StudySpark would provide one organized space
        for notes, resources and learning goals.
    </p>

</section>

<hr>

<section>

    <h2>✨ Key Features</h2>

    <ul>
        <li>Resource organization</li>
        <li>Subject categories</li>
        <li>Learning progress</li>
        <li>Study reminders</li>
        <li>Personal dashboard</li>
    </ul>

</section>

<hr>

<section>

    <h2>🎯 Target Users</h2>

    <ol>
        <li>School students</li>
        <li>College students</li>
        <li>Self-learners</li>
    </ol>

</section>

<hr>

<section>

    <h2>📈 Project Progress</h2>

    <p>Idea</p>
    <progress value="100" max="100"></progress>

    <p>Planning</p>
    <progress value="80" max="100"></progress>

    <p>Prototype</p>
    <progress value="40" max="100"></progress>

    <p>Launch</p>
    <progress value="10" max="100"></progress>

</section>

<hr>

<section>

    <h2>🌟 Vision</h2>

    <blockquote>
        "Make learning resources easier to organize,
        discover and use."
    </blockquote>

</section>

</main>

<footer>

    <hr>

    <p>
        StudySpark — Fictional Startup Pitch
    </p>

</footer>

</body>
</html>
